<title>USA: China corn export outlook uncertain -- USDA.</title>
<headline>China corn export outlook uncertain -- USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's export intentions are likely to remain uncertain over the next several weeks, USDA's Economic Research Service said Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;Although there is a reported exportable surplus of corn in China's northeastern provinces, there are still no firm indications that larger exports will proceed,&quot; USDA's monthly feed outlook report said.</p>
<p>China missed an export opportunity in the spring when international prices were a record high, the report said.</p>
<p>USDA left China's 1996 corn trade estimates unchanged from last month, at exports and imports both at 500,000 tonnes.</p>
<p>-- Washington Commodities Desk (202) 898-8489</p>
